  m_Name: Rampage Cell Config 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Rampage
  Description: Demolition arena cell, intensity 1 of 4 - a quiet arena you have mostly to yourself: 59
    seeded plants totalling ~9830 prisms of cacti, spires, pines, rosettes and coral,
    filling the volume from just outside the nucleus out to the membrane, across all three
    domains, each plant one of the four elemental variations. The FOREST IS THE SAME AT
    EVERY INTENSITY (this is the shipped, play-tested arena); intensity carries 1x the
    authored wildlife and - authored in the scene, not here - twice as many crystals as
    players. The nucleus stays clear; it is the crystals' contested ground. The mature
    forest is ~396,178 volume; the VOLUME thresholds are held at their play-tested values
    rather than re-derived from that (lifeform levels are retired, so the forest is 4.08x
    lighter than when they were set) and are pending an in-editor re-measure - regenerate
    with Tools/Build/rampage_intensity.py rather than hand-editing.
